lator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 43 of those years. In 2025, February to March and March to April each came in at 44% of normal on the middle of the grids, and in 2026 so far February to March came in at 11%.</p>"}
